WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
Good morning, John.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.640
[Hank makes goat noise]

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.980
You know how I said that I lost the charger to my camcorder...

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:09.300
Well, I did, and I don't have any way to record this video.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.700
So, I'm lucky enough to have a lot of footage that I took

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:15.380
over at mom and dad's house, some of it, quite graphic.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:17.300
I mean, it's not like 'two girls and one cup' or anything.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.340
Like look, these are baby chicks and these are just pigs...

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:25.260
and these are two girl pigs mounting each other. I have nothing wrong with that.

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:27.640
But coming up is something that's a little bit disturbing.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.820
It is a goat giving birth to a baby goat.

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:32.180
And while it's not 'two girls and one cup' material,

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:35.940
I would not mind if you people pause the video right now,

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.760
and then film yourself watching this,

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.880
because I wanna see your reactions because I couldn't see my own

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:44.260
and frankly I would like to have been able to see my own reaction to this.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:45.700
[shuddering voice]
Oh, goat birth.

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:49.740
In my opinion, what you're about to hear sounds like a velociraptor puking.

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:55.100
And what you're about to see looks like a goat giving birth to a baby goat.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.520
So pause now and record if you would like to show me your reaction.

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:00.460
Otherwise, either stop the video right now.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:04.740
Get ready for some serious freaky goat birthing.

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:05.460
[song begins]

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:09.380
♪ It was a goat giving birth to a baby goat ♪

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:16.000
♪ It was a goat giving birth, oh god, that's really, really gross ♪

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.880
♪ It was a goat giving birth to a baby goat ♪

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.340
♪ The miracle of life ♪

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:26.100
♪ Right before my eyes ♪

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:31.600
♪ And all I want to do is turn the camera off and hide ♪

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:36.780
♪ It was a goat giving birth to a baby goat ♪

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:41.920
♪ Oh god... (Oh god...) ♪

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:45.520
♪ That's gross! ♪

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:48.900
[song begins]

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:52.980
And, of course, no goat birthing video would be complete without a techno remix.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.060
Hit it, Michael Aranda!

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:56.300
[song begins]

