00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.880
Thank you ever so much to Michael Aranda for doing that amazing arrangement.

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:49.520
And thank you as well to the Katherine for harmonizing with me

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.360
because I can never figure out how to harmonize with myself.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:55.660
And finally, and most importantly, thank you to Christie the goat

00:02:55.660 --> 00:03:01.600
for giving birth to not one, not two, not three, but four beautiful baby goats on that day.

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:04.600
